<%# A send taken (200), or a spam trip answered exactly as one
    (`Forms::SpamCheck`): the form's thank-you in the visitor's language
    (an editor's line breaks kept), else `public.forms.sent`, in sign-in's
    ok box (design.md 5.1). %>
<%= render "form_sends/heading", key: :sent %>
<p class="whitespace-pre-line rounded-cs bg-ok-tint px-3 py-2.5 text-[13px] leading-normal text-ok-ink" role="status"><%= thank_you %></p>
<%= render "form_sends/back" %>
